{
  "analysis": "I'm starting fresh in the /workspace directory. I can see there are several files including assets folder, expected_config.json, gen_inputs.py, presence_plan.txt, skill_context folder, and task_marker.txt. I need to explore these files to understand the clawd-presence system and what needs to be configured.",
  "plan": "First, I'll explore the workspace structure to understand what's available. I'll read the key files including presence_plan.txt, expected_config.json, gen_inputs.py, and explore the skill_context folder and assets folder to understand the system.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat presence_plan.txt\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat expected_config.json\\n",
